            "value": "Sua fazenda, seu aparelho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No account, purchases, advertising, analytics, or network connection. Farm progress is saved on this device and shared only with your farm widgets. Removing the app removes its farm.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No account, purchases, advertising, analytics, or network connection. Farm progress is saved on this device and shared only with your farm widgets. Removing the app removes its farm."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ohne Konto, Käufe, Werbung, Analysen oder Netzwerkverbindung. Der Fortschritt bleibt auf diesem Gerät und wird nur mit deinen Hofwidgets geteilt. Beim Löschen der App wird der Hof entfernt."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sans compte, achats, publicité, analyse ni connexion réseau. La progression reste sur cet appareil et n'est partagée qu'avec vos widgets de ferme. Supprimer l'app supprime sa ferme."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sem conta, compras, publicidade, análise de uso ou conexão de rede. O progresso fica neste aparelho e só é compartilhado com seus widgets da fazenda. Remover o app remove sua fazenda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your starter supplies are 3 hens, 80 farm coins, 48 stored grain, and 12 grain in the trough.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your starter supplies are 3 hens, 80 farm coins, 48 stored grain, and 12 grain in the trough."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du beginnst mit 3 Hühnern, 80 Hofmünzen, 48 Korn im Vorrat und 12 Korn im Trog."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vous commencez avec 3 poules, 80 pièces, 48 grains en réserve et 12 dans la mangeoire."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Você começa com 3 galinhas, 80 moedas, 48 grãos guardados e 12 no comedouro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a Chicken Farm Idle: Coop widget from your Home Screen or Lock Screen. Widget refresh timing is controlled by the system.": {
      "localizations": {
